      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "UnrealEngineへの移行\nVRChatは拡大を続けてきました。\nとてつもなく破滅的ですが、VRCは近いうちにプログラムの処理にボトルネックを抱えたままEACを導入します。\n（せめて一週間はテストしてほしい）\n将来的に、アンリアルエンジンへの移行を検討しなければいけなくなってきたと思います。UnityではEACを抱えたまま最適化するのは難しいと思います。",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-26T09:37:55.662Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRChat has continued to expand.\nAlthough tremendously devastating, VRC will soon be implementing EAC, leaving us with a bottleneck in program processing.\n(Give me at least a week to test it out)\nI think in the future we are going to have to consider moving to the Unreal Engine, I think it will be difficult to optimize with EAC in Unity.",
